WEBVTT

01:54.511 --> 01:56.511
Hey. Don't we have any more booze?

01:56.591 --> 01:57.721
It's my painkiller.

02:00.181 --> 02:01.141
Damn.

02:01.221 --> 02:03.181
Aren't we there yet?

02:03.261 --> 02:05.601
That place where they're supposed
to give us the money.

02:06.181 --> 02:09.141
Don't be in such a hurry.
We're almost there.

02:11.731 --> 02:14.361
The Troll's Son

02:34.921 --> 02:35.921
Damn.

02:39.051 --> 02:40.431
Damn it.

02:51.901 --> 02:54.401
-My whole body hurts.
-I want to find me a nice girl.

02:54.481 --> 02:55.861
ENGLAND
VICINITY OF HUMBER RIVER

02:56.691 --> 02:58.531
Who's going to watch the ships?

02:58.611 --> 03:00.611
We're just here to rest our bones.

03:00.701 --> 03:02.661
We're not going to stay here for long.

04:42.761 --> 04:44.221
Get up.

04:44.301 --> 04:46.341
Hey. Don't run away.
I'll kill you if you move.

04:46.931 --> 04:50.431
Don't let anyone get away.
We're going to have trouble if this gets out.

04:52.891 --> 04:54.351
Two on the right.

05:47.451 --> 05:51.451
And then the guy ate it.
He didn't even know what it was.

07:09.951 --> 07:12.361
-My head hurts.
-I drank too much.

07:16.331 --> 07:18.621
What happened?
Did you have a hard time falling asleep?

07:20.211 --> 07:22.001
There was a noisy little fly in my room.

07:22.081 --> 07:23.131
A little fly?

07:27.711 --> 07:29.631
Who's that? A survivor?

07:30.131 --> 07:33.761
No. It's the son. The Troll of Jom's kid.

07:33.841 --> 07:36.011
He's still alive?

07:36.101 --> 07:38.431
Too much trouble for the early morning.

07:39.641 --> 07:41.481
This is revenge for my father.

07:41.561 --> 07:43.271
I challenge you to a duel.

07:44.351 --> 07:46.061
Impressive, kid.

07:46.151 --> 07:47.901
I'm so scared.

07:49.781 --> 07:52.031
What are you going to do, Askeladd?

07:53.861 --> 07:55.411
What a pain.

07:56.451 --> 07:57.781
Come on.

07:57.871 --> 08:00.501
You should have cut off my head
while I was asleep.

08:03.251 --> 08:05.041
I'm the son of Thors.

08:10.011 --> 08:12.051
I'd never do something

08:12.131 --> 08:13.511
so cowardly.

08:15.891 --> 08:17.011
Wow, I'm so scared.

08:17.101 --> 08:21.021
-Did you hear that, Askeladd?
-Kill him, kid.

08:21.101 --> 08:22.141
Get him.

08:22.231 --> 08:24.561
So, you think you're a warrior?

08:25.601 --> 08:27.191
All right. Come at me.

08:42.451 --> 08:43.871
Yeah. Just like that.

08:46.711 --> 08:49.381
Someone dig him a grave.

08:49.461 --> 08:51.131
Damn. Damn.

08:51.881 --> 08:55.341
You can't let your sword
swing you around like that.

09:01.061 --> 09:02.681
You're so brutal.

09:02.771 --> 09:04.731
Maybe he's dead already.

09:06.351 --> 09:07.941
Come on.

09:20.081 --> 09:22.581
We confirmed it.

09:22.661 --> 09:24.001
Here's your money.

09:27.671 --> 09:29.751
Thank you very much.

09:30.791 --> 09:33.761
Say thanks to Floki for me.

09:39.181 --> 09:42.311
I can't get too friendly with the villagers.

09:45.181 --> 09:47.441
By the way, I have a message for you.

09:48.401 --> 09:49.311
A message?

09:49.901 --> 09:53.571
"How was Thors's final moment?"

09:58.951 --> 09:59.991
It was nothing special.

10:01.331 --> 10:04.371
He just died a normal death.

10:14.211 --> 10:15.841
What? You're still alive?

10:16.421 --> 10:18.341
You look terrible.

10:18.431 --> 10:19.551
Want some?

10:25.141 --> 10:27.351
It's not healthy to deprive yourself.

10:34.151 --> 10:35.481
What's wrong with him?

10:35.571 --> 10:37.241
We were only trying to help.

10:45.371 --> 10:46.371
Damn.

11:24.871 --> 11:26.161
Damn it.

11:29.081 --> 11:31.961
Damn it all.

11:39.421 --> 11:42.051
He died an honorable death.

11:42.761 --> 11:45.431
Thors sacrificed himself for us.

11:48.521 --> 11:51.731
I'm sorry, Helga. Ylva.

11:51.811 --> 11:55.311
My words cannot express how sorry I am.

12:01.741 --> 12:04.571
He's already dead.
No one can do anything about it now.

12:04.661 --> 12:06.781
Crying about it will just make you hungry.

12:11.121 --> 12:13.171
Time to get back to work.

12:17.421 --> 12:18.421
Helga.

12:20.131 --> 12:21.631
Thorfinn...

12:21.721 --> 12:24.761
I'm going to find him, no matter what.

12:26.341 --> 12:28.351
No matter how many years it takes.

12:32.431 --> 12:36.771
Well, I never thought he'd live a long life anyway.

12:37.311 --> 12:40.901
It's hard having a strange dad like him.

12:40.981 --> 12:43.901
Your little brother is missing, too, right?

12:43.991 --> 12:45.861
Are you okay, Ylva?

12:45.951 --> 12:48.911
I'm so busy, now that the men are all gone.

12:50.541 --> 12:51.621
Ylva.

12:53.501 --> 12:55.041
Yeah.

12:55.121 --> 12:56.581
You're crazy, Ylva.

13:00.381 --> 13:01.961
Mother, how are you feeling?

13:02.551 --> 13:05.221
Yes. I feel much better.

13:05.301 --> 13:07.181
Sorry to rely so much on you, Ylva--

13:07.261 --> 13:08.091
Okay, okay.

13:08.801 --> 13:10.761
It's okay. Don't get up.

13:15.981 --> 13:17.811
Oops, I forgot about the sheep.

13:21.071 --> 13:23.861
Okay, okay. Sorry I'm late.

13:28.821 --> 13:32.241
I must shear the sheep when spring comes too.

13:39.541 --> 13:42.091
Yeah.

13:43.341 --> 13:45.841
I got the first hit.

13:50.141 --> 13:52.011
I'm so busy.

13:52.721 --> 13:55.601
We don't have enough people to pitch in.

13:55.681 --> 13:57.391
Maybe I should get a husband.

14:01.361 --> 14:02.571
Thanks.

14:03.611 --> 14:04.861
Let's go to sleep.

14:06.991 --> 14:08.951
You can go to sleep first.

14:09.031 --> 14:10.821
I'm going to finish this.

14:12.951 --> 14:16.001
But it's dark already.

14:16.081 --> 14:17.831
You'll make a mistake.

14:20.501 --> 14:21.331
Ylva.

14:27.051 --> 14:28.971
That's enough.

14:29.051 --> 14:30.141
Get some rest.

14:30.221 --> 14:32.761
But I'm almost done.

14:32.851 --> 14:35.851
I'm okay. I'm not tired.

15:10.051 --> 15:11.381
I'm going to kill him.

15:12.511 --> 15:15.261
I'm going to kill him, no matter what.

15:24.981 --> 15:25.821
Hey.

15:27.191 --> 15:28.491
You're working hard.

15:29.571 --> 15:30.571
You.

15:31.111 --> 15:32.451
How is it?

15:32.531 --> 15:34.491
Have you gotten used to using a sword?

15:38.161 --> 15:40.461
You. It's your fault.

15:40.541 --> 15:42.291
You used me as a shield.

15:43.331 --> 15:44.461
That's why my father...

15:46.461 --> 15:48.211
You coward.

15:49.551 --> 15:52.591
Your father really was strong.

15:52.681 --> 15:54.391
But he was naive.

15:54.471 --> 15:55.721
That's all there is to it.

15:56.301 --> 15:59.601
Don't make fun of my father!

16:09.361 --> 16:12.951
Well. You're just weak.

16:26.671 --> 16:27.791
Hey.

16:28.841 --> 16:30.961
I ran into that kid in the forest.

16:32.131 --> 16:35.091
What? He's still alive?

16:35.181 --> 16:37.761
The blood of the Troll of Jom runs through his veins.

16:37.851 --> 16:39.971
He's not going to die that easily.

16:45.561 --> 16:47.651
Like father, like son.

17:16.431 --> 17:19.851
You can't let your sword
swing you around like that.

18:16.401 --> 18:17.401
Damn.

19:19.971 --> 19:22.011
We ended up staying here for a long time.

19:22.091 --> 19:24.511
I feel great now.

19:24.601 --> 19:26.561
What a comfortable village.

19:26.641 --> 19:27.641
Someone's coming.

19:36.231 --> 19:38.741
I'm Thors' son, Thorfinn.

19:39.611 --> 19:41.611
In the name of Odin, the Almighty,

19:42.821 --> 19:44.871
I challenge you to a duel.

19:46.781 --> 19:48.871
Come on. You're so annoying.

19:49.331 --> 19:51.661
You're pretty brave.

19:51.751 --> 19:53.751
Accept the duel, Askeladd.

19:56.711 --> 19:58.171
It's decided, then.

19:58.251 --> 20:01.221
It's the leader's job to meet his men's expectations.

20:07.971 --> 20:11.681
I, Askeladd, son of Olaf,
swear in the name of Odin

20:11.771 --> 20:14.851
that I accept your duel,
because I have no choice.

20:18.481 --> 20:19.781
Come on.

20:19.861 --> 20:22.361
Are you that eager to go meet your father?

21:01.441 --> 21:02.991
It's over.

21:03.071 --> 21:04.531
He can't win.

21:10.161 --> 21:11.331
Come on.

21:12.501 --> 21:14.411
Have you finished?

21:15.711 --> 21:17.831
How boring.

21:17.921 --> 21:19.461
Get up.

21:20.501 --> 21:21.841
This is a duel.

21:21.921 --> 21:25.341
I think that's enough. He's going to die.

21:27.301 --> 21:31.601
What's wrong?
You're the one who told me to kill him.

21:54.161 --> 21:57.581
That's it. I've had enough.

21:58.291 --> 22:00.751
I don't enjoy killing kids.

22:02.751 --> 22:04.211
Why?

22:04.301 --> 22:05.551
What do you mean?

22:05.631 --> 22:08.221
I'm busy too.

22:08.301 --> 22:09.431
Wait.

22:09.511 --> 22:11.391
I haven't lost.

22:11.471 --> 22:13.851
Fight. You coward.

22:14.311 --> 22:16.181
You're persistent, kid.

22:16.271 --> 22:17.941
It's not over yet.

22:18.021 --> 22:19.981
It's not over until I kill you.

22:20.061 --> 22:21.611
I swear, I will kill you.

22:27.701 --> 22:29.781
Try achieving something great on the battlefield.

22:31.031 --> 22:32.991
You're a Viking, right?

22:34.701 --> 22:35.751
Then...

22:36.791 --> 22:39.291
I'll reward you with a duel.

22:48.091 --> 22:49.301
That's a promise?

22:49.931 --> 22:53.051
Right. A promise between warriors.

22:58.891 --> 23:00.561
I'll achieve something in no time.

23:02.731 --> 23:04.231
And then...

23:05.531 --> 23:06.691
you'll die...

23:07.901 --> 23:09.201
by my hands.
